if binding: read true, freed while the function runs 1
if binding: freed after the function returned 1
block local: read true, freed while the function runs 1
block local: freed after the function returned 1
no binding: read true, freed while the function runs 1
no binding: freed after the function returned 1
call argument: read true, freed while the function runs 0
call argument: freed after the function returned 1
